    "heading": "Reaction and Bonus Action Triggers",
    "lineStart": 7249,
    "lineEnd": 7251
  },
  "section": "7.15",
  "rulesText": "A spell that has a casting time of a Reaction is cast in response to a trigger that is defined in the spell's Casting Time entry. Some spells that have a casting time of a Bonus Action are also cast in response to a trigger defined in the spell."
}
